{"id":"91b4c987294d365f","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-skolem-function.md","title":"ZFC Skolem Function","display":"df-zfc-skolem-function — ZFC Skolem Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-skolem-function","aliases":["58-df-zfc-skolem-function","58-df-zfc-logic-skolem-function","58-df-zfc-logic9-skolem-function"],"display":"df-zfc-skolem-function — ZFC Skolem Function","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch07/58-df-skolem-function.md]]","[[58-df-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-skolem-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-skolem-function</span><span>58-df-zfc-logic-skolem-function</span><span>58-df-zfc-logic9-skolem-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-skolem-function — ZFC Skolem Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e7eb620808ce373c\" href=\"?note=e7eb620808ce373c\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-skolem-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-skolem-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,M,\\varphi,L,x,\\bar y,k\\in V\">\\(f,M,\\varphi,L,x,\\bar y,k\\in V\\)</span>, where <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> is a coded structure</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span> is the imported structure predicate</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_{M}(f,\\varphi,x,\\bar y,k)\">\\(\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_{M}(f,\\varphi,x,\\bar y,k)\\)</span> is the imported semantic Skolem-function predicate</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_S(f,M,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists L,x,\\bar y,k\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\\land k\\in\\omega\n\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land\\bar y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^k\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_{M}(f,\\varphi,x,\\bar y,k)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_S(f,M,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists L,x,\\bar y,k\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\\land k\\in\\omega\n\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land\\bar y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^k\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_{M}(f,\\varphi,x,\\bar y,k)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This compatibility predicate now delegates to the existing satisfaction-\nbased Skolem-function definition instead of using an undeclared\nthree-place <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sat}_S\\)</span> symbol.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-logic-skolem-function</code> and <code>58-df-zfc-logic9-skolem-function</code> are merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-skolem-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7eb620808ce373c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-skolem-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-structure]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,M,\\varphi,L,x,\\bar y,k\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_{M}(f,\\varphi,x,\\bar y,k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_S(f,M,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists L,x,\\bar y,k\\;\\Bigl(&\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\\land k\\in\\omega\n\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land\\bar y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^k\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_{M}(f,\\varphi,x,\\bar y,k)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sat}_S","display":false}],"bytes":1373,"backlinks":[{"id":"f878362f76577a34","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"169d038a6c234a56","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (结构 $M$ 的公式 Skolem 函数关系, see [[58-df-zfc-skolem-function]])"},{"id":"fb0405497b16b145","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_S$ (Skolem-function predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-skolem-function]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3491","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../ba